<title>FRANCE: RUGBY UNION-FRENCH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-FRENCH CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of play-off matches in the</p>
<p>French rugby union championship on Sunday (winners through to</p>
<p>round of 16):</p>
<p>Group 1:</p>
<p>Begles-Bordeaux 15  Stade Francais 14</p>
<p> Castres	   49  La Rochelle     9</p>
<p> Biarritz	  28  Nice	     11</p>
<p> Narbonne	  29  Montpellier    16</p>
<p>(Note: losers stay in first division).</p>
<p>Group 2:</p>
<p> Toulon	    29  Racing	   25</p>
<p> Beziers	   31  Aurillac	 22</p>
<p> Grenoble	  40  Rumilly	  17</p>
<p> Colomiers	 37  Valence d'Agen  3</p>
<p>(Note: losers are relegated to second division).</p>
<p>Round of 16 draw (matches to be played on May 10 and 11):</p>
<p>Pau v Castres</p>
<p>Perpignan v Begles-Bordeaux</p>
<p>Agen v Grenoble</p>
<p>Toulouse v Narbonne</p>
<p>Brive v Colomiers</p>
<p>Dax v Biarritz</p>
<p>Montferrand v Toulon</p>
<p>Bourgoin v Beziers</p>
</text>
